{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Before I address supervision, I need to share the findings from my room-safety review, which I completed this week. The review found that the makerspace may enroll no more than 16 students, and any session using soldering stations with more than 12 students requires two supervising adults. The draft program form still shows the original numbers — 24 students and one supervisor — but those will need to be revised to comply with the safety review."}
```

